# Rename (or copy) this file to:
#   data/TEAM_STATS_ASOF_REBUILD_COMPLETE
# to mark the team-stats as-of rebuild complete and lift the MLB
# retrain/sweep freeze in config.assert_retrain_allowed.
#
# Only create the marker AFTER the rebuild is verified
# (docs/team_stats_leak.md, docs/team_stats_rebuild_scope.md).
# Contents are ignored; presence is the signal.
#
# Equivalent env override (no file needed):
#   TEAM_STATS_ASOF_REBUILD_COMPLETE=1
